# seed.ll is a generated compiler artifact (machine-emitted LLVM IR,
# ~500k lines, version-locked to the source that produced it). Text
# diffs are noise and text merges are always wrong — the only correct
# conflict resolution is to pick one side as a bootstrap stepping
# stone and regenerate from the merged source (make update-seed).
# See bootstrap/docs/SEED_MERGES.md.
bootstrap/seed/seed.ll -diff merge=binary
